{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/d38151bf22390eb002d286dd076cd8dd.poster.avif?t=1759407621\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/d38151bf22390eb002d286dd076cd8dd.webm?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/d38151bf22390eb002d286dd076cd8dd.mp4?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>SWARM SURVIVORS</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>GREX</strong>, you are the <strong>Swarm</strong>. It's a fast-paced <strong>roguelite auto-shooter</strong> where chaos fills the arena and your body is your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every enemy  has unique behavior, so survival requires some\u00a0<strong>player skill</strong> or a <strong>broken build</strong>. Often both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b32f9915507d72e61bd4ec3d12cfa1f1.poster.avif?t=1759407621\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b32f9915507d72e61bd4ec3d12cfa1f1.webm?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/b32f9915507d72e61bd4ec3d12cfa1f1.mp4?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUILD YOUR PERFECT SWARM</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kill &amp; Collect</strong> \u2013 Slay enemies, level up, grab diamonds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genes</strong> \u2013 Mix types to create unique Grexlings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Merging</strong> \u2013 Fuse genes into higher tiers for more power.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Passive Items</strong> \u2013 Strong boosts, always with a cost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Up</strong> \u2013 Raise stats to improve Genes &amp; Items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digging</strong> \u2013 Break the arena floor to find healing &amp; diamonds.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/88b2c2e64cda9a7cc3070bb290dde045.poster.avif?t=1759407621\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/88b2c2e64cda9a7cc3070bb290dde045.webm?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/88b2c2e64cda9a7cc3070bb290dde045.mp4?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>ROGUELITE PROGRESSION</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock Permanent <strong>Skill Tree</strong> upgrades between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow stronger every attempt.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.poster.avif?t=1759407621\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.webm?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/extras/288c6240c1132f156e98eed5116f464c.mp4?t=1759407621\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DISCOVER &amp; UNLOCK</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <strong>Swarm species</strong> with unique playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rare <strong>items, rewards, and genes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless <strong>build combinations</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(W.I.P. \u2014 more content coming!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FINAL CHALLENGE: &quot;Vanilla Mode&quot;</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reset Skill Tree &amp; upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start from zero.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the <strong>final boss</strong> in pure vanilla chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GREX</strong> blends the chaos of <strong>bullet heaven survivors</strong> with deep <strong>roguelite progression</strong>, wild <strong>build crafting</strong>, and the thrill of controlling an entire <strong>swarm</strong> instead of just one hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you survive the cosmic carnage?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have fun Swarming!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yours, Mike</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3415870?t=1759407621","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/1f7247d039ded3c64c6dacd1cb327b98a3493ede/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759407621","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3415870/5cf26fbe25b68bc450af6b496a3f358259d959c6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759407621","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea